# @adjudicate/audit — ledger feature-flag environment variables
#
# Phase F: enable shadow writes (record but do not enforce).
# Phase G: flip enforce to make checkLedger() authoritative on writes.

# Enable shadow ledger writes (Phase F). Set to 1/true/yes/on.
# IBX_LEDGER_ENABLED=

# Make the ledger authoritative on writes (Phase G). Requires
# IBX_LEDGER_ENABLED=true. Set to 1/true/yes/on.
# IBX_LEDGER_ENFORCE=
